{"id":1479,"title":"为什么Python为弱类型语言？","summary":"为什么Python为弱类型语言？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"58579bb1-7cc4-34ee-aa66-3d6347bf7ec8","knowledge_id":161,"title":"为什么Python为弱类型语言？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":161,"title":"为什么Python为弱类型语言？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ebd16e90-cd56-3156-8fcb-e24d46d47813","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在Python中，我们不必为变量定义数据类型，因为Python运行时会自动根据变量值确定数据类型并分配内存。\n并且同一个变量可以存储整数、字符串或布尔数据等。\n\n**例如：**","text_html":"<p>在Python中，我们不必为变量定义数据类型，因为Python运行时会自动根据变量值确定数据类型并分配内存。\n并且同一个变量可以存储整数、字符串或布尔数据等。</p>\n<p><strong>例如：</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3a51b427-1bac-37f4-844b-286527355b1d","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"# 最开始为int 5\na = 5\n# 之后将变量改为字符串\na = 'pythontip'","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"deda44a2-c295-3c0d-b8c5-b5aaf9c88a4f","title":"","title_html":"","text":"示例中，当`a`的值更改为字符串时，Python 会自动将变量`a`的数据类型从 `int` 转换为 `str`。\n\n这就是 Python 被称为**弱类型**语言的原因。","text_html":"<p>示例中，当<code>a</code>的值更改为字符串时，Python 会自动将变量<code>a</code>的数据类型从 <code>int</code> 转换为 <code>str</code>。</p>\n<p>这就是 Python 被称为<strong>弱类型</strong>语言的原因。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4c9ee490-a02f-330c-a0ea-e6235f55328f","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"a = 5\nprint(a, type(a))\n\na = 'John'\nprint(a, type(a))\n\n# 输出:\n# 5 <class 'int'>\n# John <class 'str'>","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/027/page/1479"}
